			"notes": "# **Changelog 0.1.0-alpha**\n## Features\n- Added Quest Spawner.\n- Added Client configurations for show quest icon.\n\n## Technical\n- Added ```#quest_no_condtion_spawn``` for entity that should spawn by Quest Spawner with no condition.\n- Added ```#quest_spawn_blacklist``` for entity that should not spawn by Quest Spawner in any circumstance.\n### API\n- Added [```QuestData```](https://github.com/FireMuffin303/MuffinsQuestLib/blob/master/src/main/java/net/firemuffin303/muffinsquestlib/api/data/QuestData.java) for custom quest type API\n- Added [```QuestTradeOffer```](https://github.com/FireMuffin303/MuffinsQuestLib/blob/master/src/main/java/net/firemuffin303/muffinsquestlib/api/QuestTradeOffers.java) for villager trades."
